MEMO
To:
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
From:
Connor White, Planner II
Subject: UDC-21-00454 / Sweetgrass, 9th Filing / Final Plat
Date:
February 14, 2022

Background:
The item for consideration is a Final Plat. This is approved by Resolution.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral 2/14/2022
•
Public Services Committee 2/23/2022
•
2nd reading (or final consideration 2/28/2022

Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their February 7, 2022 meeting and by a vote of 5-0,
recommended the Governing Body approve this application.

The Planning Commission Staff report is attached.

Conditions were placed on the approval. All conditions were technical corrections that needed to be
made. The applicant has submitted a revised final map that addresses these comments. The revised map
has also added additional open space.

Attachments:
1. Resolution
2. Planning Commission Staff Report
3. Revised Final Map

